OL,3,GNEWSATurtle returns to sea after 22
OL,4,Ayears recovering in Irish aquarium
OL,5,
OL,6,FMary Cronin's children Barry and
OL,7,FAisling were still young when the
OL,8,Ffamily found a severely injured sea
OL,9,Fturtle buried beneath storm debris on
OL,10,Fan Irish beach.
OL,12,FMore than 22 years later, Barry and
OL,13,FAisling have grown up and moved abroad
OL,14,Fand now Molly the loggerhead has left
OL,15,FIreland too.
OL,17,FAfter two decades of gradual
OL,18,Frehabilitation and veterinary care
OL,19,Fadvances, the rescued turtle has been
OL,20,Freleased back into the ocean.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
