OL,3,GNEWSATurtle returns to sea after 22
OL,4,Ayears recovering in Irish aquarium
OL,5,
OL,6,FBecause of severe injuries to her front
OL,7,Fflippers, believed to have been caused
OL,8,Fby a shark attack, staff feared she
OL,9,Fmight never be strong enough to survive
OL,10,Fat sea.
